  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  use math.atan2 because Double precision; fastcall.</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Returns a float that is the [](https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/File:Wikipedia-16px.png)&amp;#8201;<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Atan2" target="_blank">arctangent2</a> of <b>y</b>, <b>x</b>.</p>
</p>
